sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Game Code
    participant Audio as pixelforge_audio
    participant Ring as BufferCommand
    participant Backend as pixelforge_ebiten Audio
    participant Mixer as Stereo Mixer

    User->>Audio: LoadSample rawData 22050
    Audio->>Audio: NewSample data rate
    User->>Audio: Play Chan1 sample pitch=1.0 vol=0.8
    Audio->>Audio: SetSample Chan1 sample 0 delay=0
    Audio->>Ring: NextWritePointer append CommandSetSample
    Audio->>Ring: NextWritePointer append CommandSetVolume
    Note over Ring: Commands sorted by scheduled time
    loop Audio Callback 44.1kHz
        Backend->>Ring: Read commands where time less= now
        Backend->>Mixer: Set active sample for channel 1
        Backend->>Mixer: Set volume for channel 1
        Mixer->>Mixer: Mix channels 0-3 to Left, 1-2 to Right
        Mixer-->>Backend: Stereo PCM output
    end